==Icelandic==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|is|til að}}

===Conjunction===
{{head|is|conjunction}}

# [[in order to]], [[so that]]
#: {{syn|is|í því skyni að}}

====Usage notes====
* After '''til þess að''', an infinitive is used if a subject is not specified.
*: ''Hann hringdi í mig '''til þess að''' segja að hann elskar mig.'' (He phoned me '''in order to''' say that he loves me).
* When a subject is specified, the subjunctive is used.
*: ''Hann hringdi í mig '''til þess að''' hann gæti sagt mér að hann elskar mig.'' (He phoned me '''so that''' he could tell me that he loves me.)

